        "question_pNyVKy": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will the bracelet fit?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>Measure Your Wrist</strong></p><p>Start with a flexible tape measure, a strip of paper, or string.</p><p>Wrap it around your wrist, just above the <br/>hand but below the wrist bone, where you normally wear your bracelet. <br/>Snug, but not tight.</p><p>Mark the point where the ends meet, then measure that length.</p><p>Write down your exact measurement, then add 1-2 cm for your preferred fit.<br/><br/><a href=\"https://elegatto.com/pages/size-guide?_pos=1&_psq=sizing+guide&_ss=e&_v=1.0\" title=\"https://elegatto.com/pages/size-guide?_pos=1&_psq=sizing+guide&_ss=e&_v=1.0\"><strong>Learn More</strong></a></p>"
          }
        },
        "question-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Oh... I lost the the pin of my shackle",
            "answer": "<p>If you lost your pin or would like extras, please order either a new screw or a new shackle with the screw <a href=\"https://elegatto.com/collections/shackles-parts\" title=\"Shackles & Parts\"><strong>here</strong></a>. Please make sure the correct shackle size and screw size are selected by viewing the product description. There it will let you know the exact styles that are compatible with the size of the shackle and screw selected.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I maintain my bracelet? Can I shower with my Elegatto bracelet?",
            "answer": "<p>Our leather bracelets are made of <strong>Real Top Grain Italian Leather</strong> which makes it incredibly soft and comfortable on the wrist. </p><p>Since the bracelets are made of real leather; we don’t recommend getting your Elegatto bracelet soaking wet by wearing it in the shower or while swimming. Our beaded bracelets feature a cotton rope which will show normal wear as you expand the ropes. We do not recommend getting the cotton rope soaking wet or wearing it in the shower nor while swimming. Please spot clean all leather, cotton, nylon and beaded bracelets with mild soap and a damp cloth as needed allowing to air dry. We do not recommend placing it directly in the sun or using any kind of heat to dry.</p><p></p><p><strong>Can I shower with my Elegatto bracelet:</strong></p><p>Excellent question. All of our bracelets are weather-resistant; however, please note that long-term exposure to extreme wet conditions such as showers/baths, swimming, and daily workouts might affect the long-term durability of the bracelet itself. <br/></p><p>Cuff/Beaded Styles, Leather Styles: Because our collection is made out of leather, exposing it to wet conditions and manmade chemicals and then allowing it to dry constantly will cause the leather to lose its natural oils resulting in a brittle feel down the road. We do not recommend showering/bathing with the item on or submerging the bracelet in regular and chlorinated water. </p><p></p><p>Nylon/Cotton Styles: Although our Nylon and Cotton are of excellent quality, we do not recommend showering/bathing or submerging this style in normal water and chlorinated water as it will affect the integrity of the bracelet and will cause excessive stretching with time. Please spot clean using mild soap and cold water allowing to air dry. Do not toss in the wash or submerge completely in water when cleaning.</p><p></p><p>We are not held liable to replace any styles that show wear and tear due to water exposure.</p><h1></h1>"
          }
        },
        "d90e6c10-e48f-43df-838e-0924c738df6e": {
          "type": "category",
